+  3. `POST /start_finetuning`. The LoRA then trains in the gaps of the continuing traffic and is exported to
+     `final/`.
+
+  Result (2026-10-19, `EXPERIMENTS.md` rsi-e2e-1): Formula 68.0 → **75.0** from 427 self-generated rows, trained in
+  4.6 min under traffic. TTFT SLO 99.5 % → 96.6 % (p50 38 → 84 ms, p99 54 → 725 ms).
+- Not yet covered: AppWorld / WebArena (samples up to 28–32K tokens), MLP LoRA.
